nts","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/json","state":"uploaded","size":653,"digest":"sha256:ea1994e51e39d0a4c8b282ef4555755445a77a233fecb8db0bc3b1e95a2be223","download_count":0,"created_at":"2026-11-21T10:31:25Z","updated_at":"2026-11-21T10:31:26Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/enginsoysal/engacer-os/releases/download/m147-v0.14.7/m14stage7-starter-manifest.json"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/enginsoysal/engacer-os/tarball/m147-v0.14.7","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/enginsoysal/engacer-os/zipball/m147-v0.14.7","body":"# Engacer OS M14.7 - Original reusable MSI installation\n\nNative/source/media qualification passes: **98 native and 39 supporting host groups across 138 campaign tasks**, including exact enabled-device VMware installation and two independent starts. Build `1fb03f1b582d4d153441b6b5ca40da06` binds compiled source `ad9ea25eea112dddb662c506c7631989b63b78b3` and 765 exact inputs. Public download and website verification are separate delivery gates; the current status records their completion.\n\n## What works\n\nThe production engine reads original MSI tables, costs selected files/features, stages checked original payloads, records durable ownership and publishes registration after verification. The original 7-Zip 26.06 and Notepad++ 8.9.9.1 x64 MSI profiles install, remove and reinstall. Required original Notepad++ WiX copy/delete bodies execute on native action threads with real child operations. Unsupported required behavior refuses before target changes.\n\nThe default and existing-French-preference Notepad++ profiles verify all 217 payloads and the shortcut. Seventy-six independent readbacks verify actual durable registry after/before images. Changed, unknown, Unicode and differently cased files are preserved; a separate original 7-Zip scenario preserves a 33-MiB changed file and metadata. Private precondition/fault fixtures are explicitly identified rather than attributed to unchanged production dispatchers.\n\nWindows Apps provides a source chooser, read-only review, source-change refusal, confirmation, installed-app inventory and guided removal/recovery. Opening an MSI from Files requires review before installation. Removal uses its checked cached original installer after the download is deleted. Protected completion cleanup also resumes after the source cache or product root has gone. Native ordinary cancellation, source-free recovery and labelled tail-fault cases pass.\n\nOriginal Windows instructions execute through Engacer OS's own kernel and compatibility APIs. An embedded Windows guest, host Windows Installer or replacement vendor DLL does not perform these tasks.\n\n## Matching media\n\n- `EngacerOS-M14STAGE7.iso` SHA-256: `d5f1e6111090fc8e28e4463579666cc955eecbf6650b81bcfc5e06d561ee2a42`.\n- `EngacerOS-M14STAGE7-VMware.zip` SHA-256: `597ceab54abb31815aa7b4ce6607b945ad511454856b22a715d04c2de8d62bf5`.\n- Use the complete matching package and its checksums. Public assets are independently downloaded and verified after publication; see the current delivery status.\n\n## Resources and limits\n\nThe tested Notepad++ native install tasks peak at 4219 managed pages in the default profile and 4542 in the French profile; all eight install/remove/reinstall/remove tasks retain zero managed pages. These are task measurements, separate from fixed kernel data, framebuffer storage, caches and configured VM RAM. The desktop fixed-state increase from M14.6 is eight bytes. These are overlapping component scopes, not whole-system RAM totals or faster-than-Windows claims.\n\nThe engine has explicit MSI, cabinet, file, property and journal bounds. Unsupported required tables/actions, transforms, upgrades and shared-component scenarios are not silently accepted. Arbitrary MSI packages are not qualified.\n\nNotepad++ editor operation, SumatraPDF installation/interface, full original graphical archive tasks, Firefox execution and general Windows compatibility remain unqualified. EXE installers, desktop integration, required runtimes/COM and full original-app scenarios continue in M14.8-M14.12. Whole-system CPU/RAM/storage optimization blocks final M14.15.\n\nThe unreviewed supplied-MSI screen still has a helper paragraph referring to the included 7-Zip; choose the visible Review installer action. Unreviewed supplied packages cannot install. The wording is recorded for M14.9. One initial desktop close-control observation refused before the menu fixture ran; the exact unchanged observer subsequently passed all 21 cycles. Both results are preserved and no root cause or OS fix is claimed.\n\nReported advanced BrixCanvas search/sidebar/ordered navigation remains unqualified and nonblocking under the owner's publication instruction. Available public content/layouts and downloads are verified separately.\n\n## Guides and exact evidence\n\n- [Install and restart in VMware](https://github.com/enginsoysal/engacer-os/blob/5da7ad0034c91bfd59a1ec0c7f63a16c0a4c80e3/docs/handbook/install-m147.md)\n- [First day](https://github.com/enginsoysal/engacer-os/blob/5da7ad0034c91bfd59a1ec0c7f63a16c0a4c80e3/docs/handbook/first-day-m147.md)\n- [MSI installation, removal and recovery](https://github.com/enginsoysal/engacer-os/blob/5da7ad0034c91bfd59a1ec0c7f63a16c0a4c80e3/docs/handbook/windows-m147.md)\n- [Native acceptance](https://github.com/enginsoysal/engacer-os/blob/5da7ad0034c91bfd59a1ec0c7f63a16c0a4c80e3/evidence/M14/7/acceptance-results.json), [resource scopes](https://github.com/enginsoysal/engacer-os/blob/5da7ad0034c91bfd59a1ec0c7f63a16c0a4c80e3/evidence/M14/7/resources.json)\n- [Preserved initial observation and unchanged repeat](https://github.com/enginsoysal/engacer-os/blob/5da7ad0034c91bfd59a1ec0c7f63a16c0a4c80e3/evidence/M14/7/development/final7-initial-close-observation-refusal/repeat-scope.json)\n- [Current delivery status](https://github.com/enginsoysal/engacer-os/blob/5da7ad0034c91bfd59a1ec0c7f63a16c0a4c80e3/docs/roadmap/status.md), [stage gates](https://github.com/enginsoysal/engacer-os/blob/5da7ad0034c91bfd59a1ec0c7f63a16c0a4c80e3/docs/milestones/m14-7.md), [implementation and bounds](https://github.com/enginsoysal/engacer-os/blob/5da7ad0034c91bfd59a1ec0c7f63a16c0a4c80e3/docs/architecture/msi-m147.md)\n"}